BM25 is about finding how relevent each document is to your query!



BM25 score explained:

bm25 scores how relevent a document to a query! 3 principals:

1- TF:  how often the term appears on in the doc
2- IDF: how rare the term is across all the docs
3- length normaliatioun: penalize long docs so they dont win by being big

